 "applies_to": "ACI B8 single-sensor gas transmitters on BACnet MS/TP.",
 "summary": "The B8 is a single-sensor gas transmitter (electrochemical toxic, catalytic combustible or NDIR CO2/CH4) that runs as a BACnet MS/TP end device. It reports the gas reading, STEL, TWA, 24-hour peak and board temperature as analog inputs, eight alarm-status BVs, and the state of three relays and three buzzers as binary outputs.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
